{
  "_comment": [
    "Labeled PII fixture set for TASK-012. `expected` lists every substring that MUST be",
    "redacted. Items with an empty `expected` are negative controls: they contain text that",
    "looks like PII to a naive regex and must survive untouched.",
    "",
    "The negatives are not padding. C-03 names over-redaction as the highest risk in this",
    "component, because a distiller cannot find a pattern in text that has been scrubbed",
    "into uniformity. Order numbers, totals, version strings, and dates all live in agent",
    "transcripts and all resemble phone numbers or national ids.",
    "",
    "`policy` selects the redaction policy a case is scored under. Omitted means default.",
    "'strict_phone' cases are scored under the telecom policy, where a bare digit run is a",
    "subscriber number rather than an order id. That tradeoff is ASM-006, not a detector bug."
  ],
